\b Work Location Tracker - Installation and privacy notice\b0\par
\par
This software is provided for personal work-location record keeping. It records coarse computer activity, work-session times and network identity locally on the installed computer.\par
\par
It does not record application names, window titles, websites, keystrokes, clipboard contents, files, packet contents or browsing history. It does not upload information.\par
\par
The software is provided as-is without warranty. Review exported records before relying on them for payroll, taxation or other formal purposes.\par
